<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12459] Searching checkpoint record in WAL doesn&apos;t work with segment compaction</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12459</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;During iteration over WAL we have two invariants about result(Tuple&amp;lt;WALPointer, WALRecord&amp;gt;):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;WALPointer equal to WALRecord.position() when segment is uncompacted&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;WALPointer not equal to WALRecord.position() when the segment is compacted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, the second variant is broken in FileWriteAheadLogManager#read(WALPointer ptr)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
